{"3860250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Noah Simulator", "steam_appid": 3860250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is on the verge of destruction. With a divine mission, you become humanity’s last hope as Noah.<br><strong>Noah Simulator</strong> takes the player on an epic journey across 7 different ancient civilizations.<br>Build the ark, gather rare animals, complete cross-civilization quests, and race against the coming great flood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>7 Discoverable Civilizations</strong><br>Babylonians, Egyptians, Phoenicians, and more await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐘 <strong>Animal Collection System</strong><br>Catch, convince, and bring every kind of animal aboard your ark.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/7d997897d723c6144beec33f8fa4561f.poster.avif?t=1773928282\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/7d997897d723c6144beec33f8fa4561f.webm?t=1773928282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/7d997897d723c6144beec33f8fa4561f.mp4?t=1773928282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛶 <strong>Shipbuilding</strong><br>Collect resources, combine parts, and raise the legendary ark.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/c554f6d2c370ff64d3dcc5816502ef5b.poster.avif?t=1773928282\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/c554f6d2c370ff64d3dcc5816502ef5b.webm?t=1773928282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/c554f6d2c370ff64d3dcc5816502ef5b.mp4?t=1773928282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Quests and Diplomacy</strong><br>Each civilization reacts differently — will you gain support or make enemies?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/843f078f66e7b6b6ca53f84150b2c938.poster.avif?t=1773928282\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/843f078f66e7b6b6ca53f84150b2c938.webm?t=1773928282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860250/extras/843f078f66e7b6b6ca53f84150b2c938.mp4?t=1773928282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>Race Against Time</strong><br>The flood is coming. Your decisions could change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦️ <strong>Survival Mechanics</strong><br>Fight hunger, thirst, disease, and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Open World Freedom</strong><br>Explore the map however you want. Complete quests in any order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Noachic legends, this rewritten tale offers a powerful simulation where history and mysticism blend together.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is on the verge of destruction. With a divine mission, you become humanity’s last hope as Noah.<br><strong>Noah Simulator</strong> takes the player on an epic journey across 7 different ancient civilizations.<br>Build the ark, gather rare animals, complete cross-civilization quests, and race against the coming great flood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p cla